NAME
       logname - print the name you logged in with

SYNOPSIS
       logname

DESCRIPTION
       logname prints the user name of the login session, which stays the
       same after su or sudo; whoami prints the user you are acting as now.
       After logging in as student and running sudo -i, logname still says
       student while whoami says root.

SEE ALSO
       whoami(1), id(1), who(1)
